msgid "⟪k:0⟫That tale would have been far easier on you, I’m sure."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ce conte aurait été bien plus aisé à supporter, j’en suis sûre."

#: scenario2:scenario2_E7DB052E_DAD7_459E_BC56_0801A835C943
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c3aa3a2ed954ea0ded84eee59703539482334b2918bc359a2b75397fa17f4a96
