msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_874CF45D_CA2E_46BD_A676_AFE0AB026104"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I do have to wonder, though—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫why did Bestia believe the woman to be a beast "
"like him?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je me demande quand même, cependant—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫pourquoi Bestia a cru que la femme était "
"une bête comme lui."

#: scenario2:scenario2_33BC129B_C537_4C10_ABB6_F03ABFCA7ECA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f2608e92c471be76d87444fb8d6341c79a589062af796b17c58e4d026a5575e3
