msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_33BC129B_C537_4C10_ABB6_F03ABFCA7ECA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Perhaps it was because her hair, eye, and skin color were similar to his own."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Peut-être était-ce à cause de ses cheveux, de ses yeux, de sa couleur de peau, similaires "
"aux siens."

#: scenario2:scenario2_89DD8F69_6BF8_4447_95E2_60A204FA750B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
