"⟪k:0⟫But was that the only reason?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Would that be enough for him to mistake her for a "
"beast?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mais était-ce la seule raison ?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Est-ce suffisant pour expliquer son erreur ?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_9C5A2C33_8B58_4458_8D69_BF0232B854AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 599684a96ea1ff1d2d6771423bdaf8d37c455963c711cdf64ee6800ef9469638
