msgid "⟪k:0⟫I have my own theory—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫his memories may have played a role."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫J’ai ma propre théorie—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫les souvenirs de Bestia ont peut-être joué un rôle."

#: scenario2:scenario2_2946D2EC_E581_45DF_9D8B_B7A09205D04B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 40c8db73eed208f00d7a88e5282d76077039c9cd94a4bc626a2595f647cb2362
