msgid "⟪k:0⟫How well have you come to understand Bestia, Master?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Et vous, avez-vous réussi à comprendre Bestia, Maître ?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_0B679438_AE79_44E5_BE4C_4CB4E204C918
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f321ca8f254123a012a55eda7b9242d006bce78480b5827878043e22364fcea0
