msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Master, if—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫like Bestia—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫you were to lose your memories and endure "
"persecution and degradation until you broke..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maître, si —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ comme Bestia —⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ vous deviez perdre la mémoire et subir "
"persécutions et humiliations jusqu’à épuisement..."

#: scenario2:scenario2_2455FA0D_CF54_4510_864E_951197A99F35
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e90d8bafb9f66c3bab30968833e0e6bc5144c4c02ae9cf53d057a808f5fc3144
