msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Just after the White-Haired Girl had disrobed, showing Bestia the difference between her and "
"him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La Fille aux Cheveux Blancs venait de se déshabiller et de montrer à Bestia la différence "
"entre elle et lui."

#: scenario2:scenario2_2567FF9A_5979_4306_94FE_B40470F900B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
